{
  "_comment": [
    "Where harvest.mjs looks for candidate articles. Canadian sources first,",
    "as docs/content-sources.md says. Every entry names the licence that",
    "lets us reprint an excerpt, and that string is copied verbatim into the",
    "source block of any article taken from it. If you cannot write that",
    "line honestly, the source does not belong here.",
    "",
    "kind: voa-section  walks /z/<section>?p=N",
    "kind: sitemap      reads an XML sitemap and filters the URLs",
    "kind: index-page   takes the links out of one listing page"
  ],
